631 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 431 0 R
/E (In the AWS serverless architecture, an HTTP request to /order is forwarded by API Gateway to DVSA-ORDER-MANAGER as a Lambda event object containing the request body, headers, and metadata. The Lambda's first responsibility is to parse the event body into an inert data structure so subsequent code can read fields like action, cart-id, and order-id and dispatch business logic accordingly. Parsing is a data operation, it converts text into a tree of strings, numbers, and objects. It is not, and must never be, a code-execution step.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
632 0 obj
<<
