/P 3327 0 R
/T (Crafted the injection payload as a file \(/tmp/exploit.json\) to avoid bash quoting issues. The payload uses the _$$ND_FUNC$$_ marker recognized by node-serialize.unserialize\(\) to execute JavaScript inside the Lambda runtime, then uses the AWS SDK v3 \(@aws-sdk/client-lambda\) to invoke DVSA-ADMIN-UPDATE-ORDERS with a synthetic event that updates the order's status field to 120 \(paid\):)
/E (Crafted the injection payload as a file \(/tmp/exploit.json\) to avoid bash quoting issues. The payload uses the _$$ND_FUNC$$_ marker recognized by node-serialize.unserialize\(\) to execute JavaScript inside the Lambda runtime, then uses the AWS SDK v3 \(@aws-sdk/client-lambda\) to invoke DVSA-ADMIN-UPDATE-ORDERS with a synthetic event that updates the order's status field to 120 \(paid\):)
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [3]
>>
