/E (Add explicit access control at the router level. Even if a future bug reintroduces an injection vector, the router itself should refuse to dispatch admin-only actions when the caller is not an admin. This is the missing authorization check that gives Lesson 5 its name.)
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [19]
>>
